    'fill-extrusion-translate-anchor',
    decodeEnum(FillExtrusionTranslateAnchor.values),
    const Literal(FillExtrusionTranslateAnchor.map),
  );

  set translateAnchor(Expression<FillExtrusionTranslateAnchor>? value) =>
      _setExpression('fill-extrusion-translate-anchor', value);

  /// Name of image in sprite to use for drawing images on extruded fills. For
  /// seamless patterns, image width and height must be a factor of two (2, 4, 8,
  /// ..., 512). Note that zoom-dependent expressions will be evaluated only at
